// Title: Remote Access Tool - Team Viewer Session Started On Linux Host
// Rule ID: 1f6b8cd4-3e60-47cc-b282-5aa1cbc9182d
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.t1133
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_remote_access_tools_teamviewer_incoming_connection.yml
